      "hook": "The Housekeeper coldly inspects the disguised noblewoman and demands to know if she can scrub stone.",
      "cliffhanger": "The Housekeeper threatens that the manor has no use for useless girls before dismissing them.",
      "why": "High tension interrogation where the protagonist's secret identity is almost exposed, ending on a threat.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger won't know the woman is actually a noblewoman in disguise until the reveal later."
